WEBVTT

00:00.480 --> 00:03.480
<b>Day 121</b>

00:13.610 --> 00:15.180
It's come into view!

00:15.600 --> 00:19.120
Let your eyes drink in this sight, Ogrou!

00:19.360 --> 00:23.380
You won't see a city of such 
soaring beauty anywhere else!

00:24.220 --> 00:27.880
The royal capital of Oswell...

00:40.520 --> 00:45.230
<i>My mock battle with Ogrekichi 
went on until the next morning.</i>

00:52.530 --> 00:53.820
Be seeing you!

00:53.820 --> 00:59.040
<i>And so, after parting with his group, 
we moved on to our final destination...</i>

00:59.350 --> 01:01.600
<i>The royal capital of Oswell.</i>

01:08.530 --> 01:13.730
Fully paved roads and indoor plumbing?

01:13.730 --> 01:16.720
The capital lives up to expectations.

01:17.190 --> 01:18.720
Impressed, are you?

01:18.720 --> 01:21.450
Our nation's boundless wisdom

01:21.450 --> 01:25.230
has allowed the capital to
continually grow and prosper.

01:27.810 --> 01:31.320
Off to the castle we go! Come now.

01:33.120 --> 01:33.990
Princess?!

01:44.120 --> 01:46.250
This is where the royal family lives?!

01:46.580 --> 01:48.250
The Umber Palace...

01:48.250 --> 01:53.540
Actually, the Umber Palace 
is specifically for Princess Rubilia.

01:53.540 --> 01:56.890
There are several other 
palaces around the capital.

01:56.890 --> 01:58.980
Well, that's excessive!

01:58.980 --> 02:01.840
This is nothing like our cave.

02:03.880 --> 02:06.060
Listen well, my good Ogrou...

02:07.710 --> 02:10.900
You have my sincere thanks 
for your protection on this journey.

02:11.260 --> 02:15.340
I shall prepare a special reward 
to reflect that gratitude,

02:15.340 --> 02:18.660
and bid you and yours 
to rest tonight in my palace.

02:33.640 --> 02:35.020
What is this?!

02:35.550 --> 02:39.760
It's excessively open in here, 
and the bed is too soft to sleep on!

02:39.760 --> 02:43.580
We've never stayed in such 
a fancy room before, huh?

02:43.580 --> 02:45.270
Up!

02:46.190 --> 02:47.770
Okay, okay.

02:48.200 --> 02:51.680
It's hard to relax in such a 
nicely scented the room...

02:53.940 --> 02:56.780
At least the kids are having 
no trouble sleeping.

03:00.030 --> 03:02.540
<b>Day 122</b>

03:08.240 --> 03:10.160
That was a good night's sleep!

03:14.050 --> 03:17.220
You've done a splendid job.

03:17.220 --> 03:21.050
In addition to the agreed-upon 
payment, I also grant you this.

03:22.190 --> 03:27.630
A note of endorsement from yours truly. 
Let's call it a Princess Bill.

03:27.630 --> 03:31.940
This will allow you 
free access to the capital.

03:34.750 --> 03:35.950
What's the matter?

03:36.400 --> 03:39.380
I'm just some random lord 
that you barely even know.

03:39.380 --> 03:42.200
Are you sure you want hand 
something like this to me?

03:42.630 --> 03:45.960
How can you be sure I won't misuse it?

03:48.210 --> 03:54.170
I have a good grasp of your character 
based on our journey together.

03:54.170 --> 03:57.110
Whether in business or battle, 
you exert the minimal amount of effort

03:57.110 --> 04:01.490
necessary for optimal results: 
highly efficient, at all times.

04:01.490 --> 04:05.220
Not only that, you carefully 
measure risk and reward

04:05.220 --> 04:07.490
to choose the appropriate course of action.

04:07.490 --> 04:11.640
I have a hard time imagining such 
a being would be foolish enough

04:11.640 --> 04:12.980
to make a foe of the kingdom.

04:13.450 --> 04:15.480
<i>This princess...</i>

04:15.910 --> 04:20.210
To say nothing of both the enjoyment 
and the value I got out of the journey.

04:20.210 --> 04:22.990
Consider it your reward for the experience.

04:23.350 --> 04:28.250
<i>She's been playing innocent, 
but she's been sizing me up the whole time.</i>

04:29.810 --> 04:32.890
Besides, with the likelihood 
that I'll need your services again,

04:32.890 --> 04:36.270
the faster you can return 
to the capital, the better.

04:36.270 --> 04:39.560
Which is to say, this will help me, as well!

04:39.560 --> 04:41.460
Make good use of it!

04:41.760 --> 04:43.760
Make good use of it!

04:45.940 --> 04:47.020
<i>Unbelievable.</i>

04:47.660 --> 04:51.060
<i>Looks like I've made friends 
with a bite-sized strategist.</i>

04:55.020 --> 04:55.650
Here you go.

04:55.650 --> 04:58.780
Thank you so much for everything.

04:58.780 --> 04:59.550
Here comes the next one...

04:58.780 --> 05:03.280
The princess' guards forbade her 
from seeing you off...

04:59.550 --> 05:00.480
Okay.

05:03.280 --> 05:05.780
We have already said our goodbyes.

05:06.260 --> 05:09.040
Make sure to keep up your training, kid.

05:09.710 --> 05:13.310
Let's see if you can land a hit on me 
the next time I see you!

05:13.980 --> 05:14.980
Right!

05:21.000 --> 05:25.110
<i>I positioned my replicants 
all over the royal capital,</i>

05:25.110 --> 05:28.350
<i>and I get the feeling that
we'll be back someday.</i>

05:28.350 --> 05:29.730
<i>But for now...</i>

05:29.730 --> 05:34.370
Okay, people, we're heading 
home to our village!

05:35.980 --> 05:38.480
<b>Day 124</b>

05:41.550 --> 05:44.570
<i>Two days out from Oswell,</i>

05:44.570 --> 05:48.670
<i>our trip back to the village along 
the shortest route was going smoothly.</i>

05:49.490 --> 05:50.370
<i>Except...</i>

05:52.040 --> 05:53.900
You still worried about that?

05:54.180 --> 05:55.260
Yes.

05:56.810 --> 05:59.780
Ogrekichi has gotten so much stronger.

05:59.780 --> 06:02.330
But I'm still just...

06:03.830 --> 06:05.670
What level are you at right now?

06:07.430 --> 06:10.580
Don't overthink it. Just answer me.

06:10.580 --> 06:14.460
What level are you right now, 
as a dhampir variant?

06:15.580 --> 06:17.500
Eighty-nine.

06:20.970 --> 06:22.870
You remember what I said, right?

06:23.240 --> 06:29.910
As long as I keep trying to get stronger, 
I'm not going to abandon any of you.

06:30.970 --> 06:32.350
Ogrou...

06:34.000 --> 06:35.990
Stop being so shy.

06:36.950 --> 06:42.220
However many hours, however many days 
you need, I'm here to help you train.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.000
Okay, Ogrou.

06:52.070 --> 06:55.100
Please! Lend me your strength.

07:00.010 --> 07:02.470
All right, everybody out!

07:02.470 --> 07:04.840
Time to help Dhami train!

07:07.560 --> 07:11.690
These are some giants I conjured 
with Lesser Giant Summoning.

07:11.690 --> 07:14.760
They're all pretty strong.

07:15.930 --> 07:18.790
I'm done looking back.

07:19.170 --> 07:21.560
Even if this doesn't help me evolve,

07:21.560 --> 07:23.930
I'm going to keep 
facing forward and training!

07:24.730 --> 07:27.390
So, don't hold back!

07:27.390 --> 07:29.970
As long as your mana holds out...

07:30.950 --> 07:32.350
Let me fight!

07:38.880 --> 07:41.080
More! I want more!

07:44.580 --> 07:47.530
<i>Dhami ultimately ended up defeating</i>

07:47.530 --> 07:53.450
<i>five black Fomorians, ten black 
trolls, and 20 black ogres.</i>

07:59.860 --> 08:02.930
I... still haven't...

08:03.770 --> 08:06.240
No. You've done well.

08:06.630 --> 08:08.510
That should be enough for today.

08:19.020 --> 08:21.520
Ogrou! What happened?

08:21.990 --> 08:24.760
I'm suddenly feeling drowsy.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.780
That's a sign of mana depletion.

08:28.230 --> 08:33.530
You've got so much mana that 
you usually never experience it.

08:34.200 --> 08:37.040
Is... that it?

08:37.870 --> 08:40.540
You should be glad this didn't 
happen during real combat.

08:41.300 --> 08:44.040
I'll keep that in mind.

08:44.040 --> 08:45.790
Everyone!

08:45.790 --> 08:48.550
Dinner is ready!

08:48.550 --> 08:49.930
Papa!

08:49.930 --> 08:51.580
Dinner!

09:06.610 --> 09:08.240
<b>The World Epic [Legend of the Black Eclipse Demon] 
sub-character Dhami has evolved.</b>

09:08.240 --> 09:10.110
<b>Having met the qualification [Evolutionary Advance], 
she has obtained the title [Glacier Empress]</b>

09:10.110 --> 09:11.740
<b>Having met the qualification [Evolutionary Advance], 
designation [Consort of the ■■] has become active.</b>

09:11.740 --> 09:13.120
<b>Title [Consort of the ■■] has changed to
 [Consort of the ■lord]</b>

09:13.120 --> 09:15.990
<b>Dhami is now [Consort of ■lord]</b>

09:15.990 --> 09:18.120
<b>With the status of [Consort of ■lord] now active, 
[Concubine of ■lord] has been unlocked.</b>

09:18.120 --> 09:19.500
<b>Searching for eligible candidates...</b>

09:19.500 --> 09:22.000
<b>Searching for eligible candidates...</b>

09:22.500 --> 09:25.500
<b>Day 125</b>

09:26.390 --> 09:30.070
Ogrou. Rise and shine. The sun's up.

09:34.380 --> 09:36.420
Dhami?! You...

09:37.010 --> 09:40.630
Thanks to you, I've been reborn.

09:40.630 --> 09:44.670
Right now, I'm a vampire noble variant.

09:46.150 --> 09:49.980
And now I can finally tell you...

09:50.890 --> 09:54.540
Hekaterina. That's my true name.

09:55.030 --> 09:58.710
I'm now officially your wife.

09:59.400 --> 10:00.750
From now on...

10:09.570 --> 10:12.540
Wow, I didn't think this 
would be so embarrassing!

10:12.540 --> 10:17.050
I figured I should try and act classy 
since I'm vampire nobility now, but...

10:18.390 --> 10:19.430
I'm so glad!

10:20.390 --> 10:26.760
Glad that you're stronger, 
but more because you're able to laugh again.

10:27.070 --> 10:30.790
Nothing could make me happier than that!

10:32.970 --> 10:34.230
Ogrou...

10:35.320 --> 10:37.820
<b>Day 126</b>

10:38.750 --> 10:43.830
<i>The next day, we finally returned 
to the forest where we were born.</i>

10:46.580 --> 10:48.520
It's been so long.

10:48.520 --> 10:51.610
Yeah. The trip took about a month,

10:51.610 --> 10:54.130
but it feels like it's been even longer.

10:54.770 --> 10:58.850
I honestly miss that dark, dank cave.

10:58.850 --> 11:02.350
It was feeling a little cramped 
with all the new additions, too.

11:02.350 --> 11:06.490
Well, it might not be big, 
but our home sure is cozy!

11:16.600 --> 11:22.410
Well... this isn't very dark or dank at all.

11:22.410 --> 11:25.000
Not to mention... it's huge.

11:25.470 --> 11:27.000
You finally made it!

11:27.000 --> 11:31.000
We all arrived before your group, Ogrou.

11:31.000 --> 11:35.010
We've done a few renovations,
 since it was so cramped.

11:35.010 --> 11:37.600
You call this a "few"?!

11:37.600 --> 11:41.260
Well, you're normally the one 
who surprises us, Ogrou!

11:41.590 --> 11:44.660
We thought it'd be a nice change 
of pace to switch things around.

11:44.660 --> 11:46.430
Granted...

11:46.430 --> 11:51.770
Earthe and Ogrekichi did 
most of the heavy lifting.

11:52.250 --> 11:55.130
A couple in love, working 
together on a project...

11:56.400 --> 11:59.270
It was so unbelievably precious!

12:02.490 --> 12:05.340
Aw, it was a team effort!

12:05.340 --> 12:07.660
Besides, we're not done yet!

12:08.220 --> 12:10.200
Let us show you around the place.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.710
Sure. That'd be great, Ogrekichi.

12:13.980 --> 12:15.520
Here, we got the farm.

12:15.520 --> 12:19.930
We've got plenty more personnel, so I figure 
we ought to try and be self-sufficient.

12:20.930 --> 12:22.670
Ogrou!

12:23.180 --> 12:26.920
I'm all done planting the
 vegetable and fruit seeds.

12:26.920 --> 12:31.200
<i>It seems like the dryad I met 
has moved into the compound.</i>

12:31.200 --> 12:33.190
<i>She's even ranked up...</i>

12:34.370 --> 12:37.830
You can call me "Dorianne" from now on.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.570
Here's our ranch.

12:42.740 --> 12:45.830
Kumajiro and Kurosaburo! 
You guys are looking well!

12:47.560 --> 12:49.340
This is the residential block.

12:49.340 --> 12:51.710
This place is huge now.

12:51.710 --> 12:54.570
We've got plenty of new friends, after all.

12:55.910 --> 12:59.140
<i>These cat-looking creatures are cat-siths.</i>

12:59.140 --> 13:03.590
<i>They're not skilled at combat,
 but they're pretty good with their hands.</i>

13:03.590 --> 13:04.720
<i>And above all else...</i>

13:04.720 --> 13:06.250
Oh, no!

13:06.250 --> 13:09.430
They're so fluffy! So fluffy!

13:09.430 --> 13:11.730
<i>Above all else, they're cute!</i>

13:11.730 --> 13:13.460
B-Big trouble!

13:13.950 --> 13:17.730
What's the matter? 
You look downright panicked, Seiji.

13:17.730 --> 13:20.990
It's just... Gobjii's been 
hospitalized, and...

13:26.960 --> 13:29.950
Hey. Been a while, Gobjii.

13:29.950 --> 13:32.440
I hear you don't have much longer left.

13:33.240 --> 13:36.630
Unbelievable... just 
blurt it out, why don't you?

13:39.190 --> 13:42.380
Sir, you really shouldn't talk too much.

13:42.380 --> 13:46.860
It's fine. This'll be the last time...

13:48.400 --> 13:52.210
Actually, I wanted to make 
some introductions, Gobjii.

13:53.260 --> 13:54.030
Come on.

13:54.030 --> 13:55.680
Say hi to Grandpa.

13:55.680 --> 13:57.750
This is Argento and Auro.

13:57.750 --> 14:00.850
Along with Oniwaka and Nicola.

14:00.850 --> 14:03.030
All four of them are my children.

14:05.590 --> 14:11.290
I heard the news, but this 
is my first time seeing them.

14:12.690 --> 14:20.300
That little Gobrou that I gently held 
in my arms has kids of his own, eh?

14:20.300 --> 14:22.030
Quit lying.

14:22.030 --> 14:25.050
You might've held me up, 
but it wasn't that gentle!

14:27.220 --> 14:30.520
Actually, since we're all here, 
this is a good opportunity.

14:30.520 --> 14:33.490
Before you pass on, 
I want to tell you something.

14:34.400 --> 14:39.320
Since I'm an apostle lord, starting 
today, I'm gonna go by Aporou.

14:35.850 --> 14:39.320
<b>Apostle Lord</b>

14:39.600 --> 14:44.190
And Ogrekichi is a minotaur new 
species, so he'll be Minokichi.

14:41.110 --> 14:46.320
<b>Minotaur New Species</b>

14:44.190 --> 14:48.780
Dhami is gonna veer from the usual 
naming scheme, but she'll be Kanami.

14:47.370 --> 14:53.330
<b>Vampire Noble Variant</b>

14:48.780 --> 14:51.320
You based it off my true name, didn't you?

14:51.320 --> 14:53.620
And as for Earthe...

14:54.750 --> 14:58.510
I mean, she's an earth lord variant, 
so no real need for a change there.

14:54.750 --> 14:59.090
<b>Earth Lord Variant</b>

14:59.090 --> 15:01.590
You guys all cool with that?

15:01.590 --> 15:03.140
Of course!

15:03.140 --> 15:05.390
I guess.

15:05.390 --> 15:10.160
I might need a new name soon,
if I rank up again.

15:11.850 --> 15:17.350
Not exactly wracking that brain of yours 
to come up with those names, eh?

15:17.660 --> 15:19.290
<i>That's rich coming from you.</i>

15:19.290 --> 15:20.880
<i>I don't wanna hear that, coming from you.</i>

15:20.880 --> 15:22.860
<i>You're saying that? Really?</i>

15:23.120 --> 15:25.300
I've gotta say...

15:25.900 --> 15:31.000
That little goblin baby 
is now an apostle lord, eh?

15:32.000 --> 15:36.490
I thought I'd led a fairly long life,

15:36.490 --> 15:42.380
but at the very end, I got to see 
something pretty remarkable.

15:43.080 --> 15:47.380
Not a bad... life...

15:49.490 --> 15:50.860
Gobjii?

16:09.340 --> 16:13.020
You rest easy now, Gobjii.

16:14.990 --> 16:16.650
Don't look!

16:19.200 --> 16:22.900
You old bastard, you just 
had to ruin the moment!

16:26.210 --> 16:31.250
<i>I had heard before that Gobjii 
was a little bit over 20 years old.</i>

16:31.760 --> 16:37.390
<i>I honestly don't know how long 
the average lifespan of a goblin is.</i>

16:37.390 --> 16:42.810
<i>But even if it doesn't last long, 
as long as I spend it with my people,</i>

16:42.810 --> 16:48.170
<i>I'm going to live out this second 
life of mine to its fullest!</i>

16:50.270 --> 16:56.820
Okay, people, let's send the old fart 
off in the way only we can!

16:57.140 --> 16:58.500
How's that?

16:58.500 --> 16:59.830
What're we gonna do?

17:01.380 --> 17:03.460
We've done this a few times before,

17:03.460 --> 17:06.330
and this time, it's gonna be 
to see the results of our trips.

17:06.330 --> 17:09.420
It's time for the Parabellum Mercenary 
Company's fighting tournament!

17:11.350 --> 17:14.180
We can pick up where we left off?!

17:14.180 --> 17:15.930
Sounds like fun!

17:16.340 --> 17:17.680
Us, too!

17:17.680 --> 17:19.790
Can we join in?

17:20.320 --> 17:23.770
Oh, yeah! Daddy's gonna take 
a ton of pictures, too!

17:25.740 --> 17:27.620
The rules are simple.

17:27.620 --> 17:29.720
We all fight bare-handed.

17:29.720 --> 17:33.200
The fight's over when someone surrenders.

17:33.200 --> 17:37.830
If you kill your opponent, you're gonna 
get some pretty severe punishment.

17:38.200 --> 17:41.710
Depending on how this turns out, 
your position in the company might shift...

17:42.450 --> 17:44.410
So give it your best shot, people!

17:44.410 --> 17:45.710
Yeah!

17:47.970 --> 17:52.220
Alright, let's see what you 
got up to during your trip.

17:52.220 --> 17:54.840
I appreciate the lesson, Master!

18:04.640 --> 18:08.110
I wouldn't anticipate the same kind of 
fight as before, if I were you.

18:08.590 --> 18:11.470
I'll give you the same warning.

18:11.470 --> 18:16.120
I've obtained new spells 
with the fruits of my trip...

18:16.120 --> 18:18.380
And now I'll show that magic to you!

18:32.010 --> 18:33.780
No holding back now, okay?

18:34.260 --> 18:39.640
It should be fun to see how far we can
 go without any swords or picks!

18:43.180 --> 18:45.630
U-Um...

18:45.630 --> 18:49.320
My power isn't really suited to combat...

18:49.320 --> 18:50.500
I don't care!

18:52.080 --> 18:52.900
What the—

18:52.900 --> 18:56.530
Have mercy! I can just see 
really well! Have mercy!

19:01.900 --> 19:03.830
Why can't I hit you?!

19:01.900 --> 19:03.830
Attacking and receiving...

19:03.830 --> 19:07.250
the same kind of clash of flesh 
you see in shipping...

19:07.920 --> 19:10.060
Oh, it's so precious!

19:17.680 --> 19:18.660
Go!

19:18.660 --> 19:20.180
You can do it!

19:20.860 --> 19:23.180
I figured it'd turn out this way.

19:23.540 --> 19:27.210
Ogrou... no. Aporou!

19:28.380 --> 19:32.500
You're the reason I've become this strong.

19:32.970 --> 19:34.730
I wanna thank you.

19:35.410 --> 19:37.450
The feeling's mutual.

19:41.080 --> 19:45.210
We've come a long way, haven't we?

19:45.210 --> 19:51.210
And I'm going to win this fight, 
so I can go even further than you!

19:53.040 --> 19:57.220
Nice! That's what I love to hear, Minokichi!

20:24.140 --> 20:28.160
<i>Here are the results of the fighting festival.</i>

20:28.160 --> 20:32.220
<i>1st place: Me! 2nd place: Minokichi.</i>

20:33.170 --> 20:36.820
<i>3rd place: Kanami. 4th place: Earthe.</i>

20:37.170 --> 20:41.180
<i>5th place: Bloodsato. 6th place: Spellsei.</i>

20:38.030 --> 20:39.560
Can't stand anymore...

20:41.590 --> 20:45.680
<i>7th place: Nekki. 8th: Fuuki.</i>

20:46.230 --> 20:50.060
<i>9th Place: the steel knight. 
10th place: Goufu.</i>

20:50.750 --> 20:53.290
<i>11th place: the short-haired redhead.</i>

20:52.170 --> 20:53.290
I'm so frustrated...

20:53.290 --> 20:57.690
<i>12th place: Genki. 13th place: Dodome.</i>

20:58.380 --> 21:00.570
<i>The results aren't that surprising.</i>

21:00.570 --> 21:04.160
<i>Excluding Seiji, who's 
not exactly a combatant,</i>

21:04.160 --> 21:08.710
<i>the heads of the different squads were all 
in the upper ranks, which works for me.</i>

21:08.710 --> 21:11.190
Good work, everyone!

21:11.190 --> 21:13.460
Have some hot soup!

21:13.800 --> 21:16.220
We've got some freshly brewed liquor, too!

21:16.220 --> 21:18.460
There's plenty to go around!

21:18.460 --> 21:20.320
I'm tired...

21:20.320 --> 21:22.110
Everyone's too strong!

21:22.110 --> 21:22.970
Yeah...

21:23.310 --> 21:27.470
<i>They're all stronger. They've all grown.</i>

21:28.180 --> 21:33.240
<i>That makes me a lot happier 
than the fact that I won.</i>

21:36.480 --> 21:38.990
<b>Day 127</b>

21:46.940 --> 21:47.990
<i>What's up?</i>

21:47.990 --> 21:52.000
<i>Oh, I can hear you! It is I, Ogrou.</i>

21:52.350 --> 21:56.620
<i>It's not Ogrou anymore. I started 
going by Aporou as of yesterday.</i>

21:57.430 --> 22:00.510
So... what do you want at this hour?

22:00.850 --> 22:05.760
Well, I was looking to secure your 
services. I take it that's fine?

22:07.400 --> 22:10.650
This isn't gonna be a whole thing, is it?

22:10.650 --> 22:14.770
<i>I've no idea what you could mean.</i>

22:14.770 --> 22:19.070
Besides, this task is no grand ordeal.

22:19.070 --> 22:20.740
<i>She's playing dumb,</i>

22:20.740 --> 22:25.930
<i>but this tomboy princess 
is definitely up to something major,</i>

22:25.930 --> 22:28.730
<i>which I had already learned 
from my replicants.</i>

22:28.730 --> 22:31.290
<i>The details aren't clear yet...</i>

22:32.480 --> 22:35.200
<i>But we've got 400 members 
in the company right now.</i>

22:35.510 --> 22:38.640
<i>If we ran into major trouble 
with the kingdom...</i>

22:39.300 --> 22:45.980
Besides, I want to make your presence 
more widely known throughout the kingdom.

22:46.230 --> 22:50.560
I'm certain more notoriety 
would benefit you a great deal.

22:50.830 --> 22:55.480
<i>And, of course, she knows exactly 
how to make an appeal to me.</i>

22:55.480 --> 22:59.570
<i>This princess really is something else.</i>

23:00.050 --> 23:03.420
All right. I'll take the bait.

23:04.120 --> 23:06.090
So, what are the specifics?

23:06.090 --> 23:08.100
<i>Oh, well, you see...</i>

23:13.140 --> 23:17.780
Everybody ready? 
The Parabellum Mercenary Company...

23:18.330 --> 23:22.840
is now deploying to the 
royal capital of Oswell!

23:22.840 --> 23:24.680
Yeah!

23:26.380 --> 23:29.490
<i>We took the offer because of 
the promise of a huge reward,</i>

23:29.830 --> 23:33.220
<i>but at the time I had no idea...</i>

23:33.620 --> 23:37.070
<i>just how big of a deal 
this job would really be.</i>
